    <briefdescription>
<para>Base interface for rewrite rules. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>All rewrite rules inherit from this interface and implement deterministic matching and transformation logic. Rules are registered globally and executed in priority order.</para>
<para>THREAD-SAFE: All implementations must be thread-safe. DETERMINISTIC: Given the same input, must always produce the same output. BOUNDED: Must not introduce unbounded loops, exponential state, or pathological execution. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
